uire additional resources and new or expanded controls, and offering our services and products in new geographic regions often requires substantial expenditures and takes considerable time. We may not be successful enough in these new geographies to recoup our investments in a timely manner or at all. Such expansion, and the ongoing operation of our global business, subject our business to substantial risks, including:","section":"We have experienced certain of these risks in connection with our past acquisitions, and any of the foregoing could harm our business and negatively impact our results of operations.","block":360,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-012254","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-26","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001512673","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1512673/000162828026012254/xyz-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/32ac4fb40a9913b468b7bfe2d662dc67cc8f9c4ade308673d9814b90ac7a49b1.bin","sha256":"32ac4fb40a9913b468b7bfe2d662dc67cc8f9c4ade308673d9814b90ac7a49b1"}},{"id":"e1bfd93052bdfd46f7f3a485b8e42172466c8af48847fa5cfc08a2d4c49899eb","quote":"•failure to anticipate competitive conditions and competition with service providers or other market-players that have greater experience in the foreign markets than we do;","context":"•difficulty in attracting sellers and customers, or a lack of acceptance of our products and services in foreign markets;","section":"We have experienced certain of these risks in connection with our past acquisitions, and any of the foregoing could harm our business and negatively impact our results of operations.","block":361,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-012254","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-26","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001512673","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1512673/00